        .title-slide .tagline { font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--text-secondary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; border-top: 1px solid var(--text-secondary); padding-top: 1rem; max-width: 600px; }

        .slide-header { margin-bottom: var(--content-gap); }
        .slide-header h2 { font-size: var(--h2-size); color: var(--text-primary); max-width: 1000px; }
        .slide-header .slide-number { position: absolute; top: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem); right: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem); font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 800; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

        .split-layout { display: flex; gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem); align-items: center; height: 100%; max-height: 100%; overflow: hidden; }
        .split-text { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--content-gap); }
        .split-media { flex: 1; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100%; }
        .split-media img { box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }

        .chart-placeholder { width: 100%; height: min(45vh, 350px); background: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: var(--text-secondary); text-align: center; padding: 2rem; }
        .chart-placeholder-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; opacity: 0.5; }

        .bar-chart { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(0.5rem, 1vh, 1rem); width: 100%; max-width: 800px; margin-top: 1rem; }
        .bar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
        .bar-label { width: 120px; text-align: right; font-size: var(--body-size); color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 500; }
        .bar-track { flex: 1; height: clamp(20px, 3vh, 32px); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
        .bar-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--bar-color); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding-left: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; }
        .bar-fill.alt { background: var(--bar-color-alt); }
        .bar-fill.low { background: var(--bar-color-low); }

        .stat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); margin-top: 1rem; }
        .stat-card { background: var(--bg-secondary); padding: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem); border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-blue); }
        .stat-value { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
        .stat-label { font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.4; }

        .progress-bar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; height: 3px; background: var(--accent-blue); width: 0%; z-index: 100; transition: width 0.3s ease; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>

    <!-- Slide 1: Title -->
    <section class="slide title-slide">
        <div class="slide-content">
            <h1 class="reveal">Global CO₂ Emissions: Who Emits, How Much, and What's Changing</h1>
            <p class="subtitle reveal">Fossil fuels & industry, 1750–2024</p>
            <p class="tagline reveal">Data from the Global Carbon Budget (2025) via Our World in Data.<br>For policy analysts, climate negotiators, and sustainability researchers.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Slide 2: Global Emissions Growth -->
    <section class="slide">
        <div class="slide-content">
            <div class="slide-header reveal">
                <div class="slide-number">01</div>
                <h2>Global CO₂ Emissions Grew from 6 Bt in 1950 to Over 35 Bt Today</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="split-layout">
                <div class="split-text reveal">
                    <p>Global CO₂ emissions from fossil fuels and industry have grown dramatically since the Industrial Revolution.</p>
                    <ul class="bullet-list">
                        <li><strong>Pre-industrial:</strong> Emissions were negligible.</li>
                        <li><strong>1950 Acceleration:</strong> Reached roughly 6 billion tonnes (Bt) per year.</li>
                        <li><strong>1990 Milestone:</strong> Nearly quadrupled to over 20 Bt.</li>
                        <li><strong>Today:</strong> Exceeds 35 Bt annually. Growth has slowed, but emissions have not yet peaked.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="split-media reveal">
                    <img src="assets/figure_2.jpg" alt="Global CO2 emissions over time">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
